## `void_shrine_offering`'s reward: a sunken shrine's relic, open to anyone who
## survives the walk down (UNKEYED, no realm gate — the water is the gate). `rare`
## at `spirit_condensation` keeps it one rung under the ash-heart's legendary while
## still being the shrine's own specific object (ADR 0216 §2), realized through
## `ItemsApi.generate` seeded from the fixture id (§4).
